# Shared utilities for all lifestyle plug-ins.
#
# Will hold:
#   vault_write/    — raw/ file writer with frontmatter validator (Python lib;
#                     Node integrations can shell out via JSON or call from
#                     a sidecar)
#   schemas/        — JSON-Schema definitions of the raw/ frontmatter contract
#                     so any-language integration can validate its output
#   testing/        — fixture helpers + assertion helpers for plug-in tests
#
# First populated by the YouTube integration's MVP; subsequent integrations
# extract patterns into shared form here.
